{"version":1,"content":"<p>華為日前進一步披露了旗下全新子品牌 Osta 的首款產品信息。繼上周確認將於 11 月 20 日正式發佈 Osta 品牌，並推出首批產品後，華為現已正式公佈 Osta O1 Pro 的外觀設計與配色方案，同時在中國市場開啓新機預訂。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586874.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.083614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:48:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.078754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.078754+00:00","content_hash":"339849d857506463eb3f58621426eaba7843d73ad7a42b8184b556bec1640cbf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}